{"id":"en_the-elf-queen-s-revenge","title":"The Elf Queen's Revenge","titleEn":"The Elf Queen's Revenge","description":"Seraphina overhears her husband arranging to exchange their newborn for the child of his mistress, planning to bring up the other woman's daughter as his own. The source breaks off at this point, so the full scope of her retaliation remains unclear. What is established is the betrayal itself: a husband conspiring to pass off another woman's child as the couple's own while displacing his wife's baby. The series takes its title from the revenge that follows this discovery. Viewers who want to see how the story unfolds can follow The Elf Queen's Revenge on Dramzio.","poster":"https://pub-fd04cb02d0724cbe8719ff59aba68757.r2.dev/series/nt_the-elf-queen-s-revenge/cover.jpg","backdrop":"https://pub-fd04cb02d0724cbe8719ff59aba68757.r2.dev/series/nt_the-elf-queen-s-revenge/cover.jpg","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Royalti","دراما قصيرة","الحضر","من الصفر إلى بطل","الانتقام","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0dbk/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-elf-queen-s-revenge_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0dbk/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-elf-queen-s-revenge_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0dbk/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-elf-queen-s-revenge_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0dbk/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-elf-queen-s-revenge_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label"